    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "atĩ",
      "rationale": "Kĩgɨko kĩa gĩkũyũ kĩonjee kĩrĩa mũthahũ ahotete; Kĩhibirania kĩrĩ tu וצוה."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "ũhoro wa kũronya",
      "rationale": "Kwarĩ mũhitanĩrio wa maũndũ (kũhĩra nyũmba) matarĩ kana ma marĩ — maũndũ makũrũhana ma ũira wa ũkoreri wa mũthahũ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Mũthahũ nĩakahota atĩ ⟨ũhĩrwo⟩ nyũmba, mbere ya gũkĩa mũthahũ kũona ⟨את⟩ kuoya, nĩgetha ũthũ ũtikagĩra wothe ũrĩ nyũmba-inĩ; na thutha ũcio mũthahũ nĩagĩithĩra kũona ⟨את⟩ nyũmba.",
